{"articleNo":"554754","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=554754&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] [신청기간 연장] 2026학년도 1학기 고졸 후 학습자 장학사업(희망사다리II유형) 신규장학생 신청 안내(비수도권 대학 우선 선발 추진)","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2026.03.04","hit":"4057","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 14.5pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -14.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\">2026-1</span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\">학기&nbsp;<b>고졸 후학습자 장학사업</b></span><b style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">희망사다리&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">II</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">유형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\">신규장학생&nbsp;<b>신청기간</b>&nbsp;안내드리오니 많은</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">신청 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 14.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -14.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">신청대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;대한민국 국적자로 최종학력이 고졸이며, 성적 및 재직요건을 충족한 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">성적기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">직전학기&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">점 만점의&nbsp;</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">70</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">점 이상</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 재직요건: 심사일 기준 재직기간이&nbsp;<b>2년 이상</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(단, 현재 중소·중견기업 재직자는&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1년 이상</b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)이며, 심사일('26.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.1.) 기준 장학생 선발 대상기업에&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">재직 중</b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">인 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;<b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2026</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.3.4.(수) 9:00 ~ 3.27</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.(금) 18:00까지(1주일 연장)</span></span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></b></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&